INT. GOTHAM CITY STREETS - DAY

Andrea arrives at the scene of the latest crime, a small antique shop. The front window is shattered, and the interior is in disarray. He carefully steps inside, his eyes scanning the area.

ANDREA
(Muttering to himself)
Another one. This is getting more frequent.

He notices a small, almost invisible scratch mark on the floor near the broken window. He kneels down, examining it closely. It's a unique pattern, not something made by a common tool.

ANDREA
(Thinking)
This is different. It's not just a smash and grab.

He takes photos of the scratch mark and the overall scene, carefully documenting everything. He also finds a small piece of fabric snagged on a broken display case, a dark, unusual material. He pockets it for further analysis.

ANDREA
(To himself)
This could be a lead.

He exits the shop, deciding to head back to the Batcave to analyze the evidence.
===GAME END===
