INT. GOTHAM CITY STREETS - NIGHT

Andrea patrols the streets, his senses alert. He spots a group of thugs harassing a shopkeeper. They're clearly not the masterminds behind the recent heists, but they're still a threat to the city.

ANDREA
(Approaching the thugs)
Alright, that's enough. Leave him alone.

The thugs turn, surprised by Andrea's sudden appearance. One of them, a burly man with a scarred face, steps forward.

THUG
(Sneering)
Who do you think you are, pal? Mind your own business.

ANDREA
(Calmly)
I'm making it my business. Now, are you going to walk away, or do we have to do this the hard way?

The thugs laugh, clearly not intimidated. They pull out knives and pipes, ready for a fight. Andrea sighs, knowing that talking is no longer an option. He engages them, using his training and skills to quickly subdue them. He manages to disarm them and knock them down, but not without taking a few hits himself.

ANDREA
(Catching his breath)
That's enough. Stay down.

He leaves the thugs groaning on the ground, deciding to head back to the Batcave to analyze the evidence he collected from the crime scenes.
===GAME END===
