Andrea stands before the workbench in the Batcave, surrounded by various tools and gadgets. He decides to further enhance his equipment, knowing that the final confrontation is approaching. He focuses on upgrading his analytical tools, making them more efficient and precise.

ANDREA
(To himself)
Every advantage counts.

He spends some of his remaining resources, carefully selecting the upgrades that will be most beneficial. He fine-tunes his forensic scanner, making it more sensitive to subtle clues. He also enhances his communication device, ensuring that he can stay in contact with Bruce if needed.

ANDREA
(Satisfied)
This should do it.

He feels more prepared, knowing that he has done everything he can to be ready for the final showdown. He takes a deep breath, steeling his resolve.
