INT. MOON KNIGHT'S LAIR - NIGHT

Alex returns to the lair, feeling the weariness of the night's events. Marc, now in his Mr. Knight persona, is waiting for him, a serious expression on his face.

MARC
(calmly)
You've been busy, Alex. I've been watching your progress. You're getting closer to uncovering the truth.

ALEX
(nodding)
I think so. I've gathered some information about the Serpent's Hand. They're operating in the deeper parts of the sewers.

MARC
(pauses)
The sewers are a dangerous place. You need to be careful. Remember, sometimes the most obvious path is not the safest. Trust your instincts, and don't hesitate to adapt your plan.

ALEX
(listening intently)
I understand. Thank you, Marc.

MARC
(nods)
You've earned my trust, Alex. You can rest here. You've earned it.

Alex takes a moment to relax, feeling the tension leave his body. He knows he needs to be at his best for the challenges ahead.
